.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon\/multiPolygonWithPolygons:","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPolygon":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpolygon","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon"},{"text":" object represents a closed shape consisting of four or more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"vertices, specified as "},{"code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instances, and the edges that"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"connect them. For example, you could use a polygon shape to represent a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"building, a lake, or an area you want to highlight.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","title":"MLNPolygon","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNPolygon","kind":"identifier"}]}}}